{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Molecular.ch4_lp_dual_binding","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Molecular.ch4_lp_dual_binding","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Fin","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Fin","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.ch4_lp_dual_binding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.ch4_lp_dual_binding","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/ch4_lp_dual_binding.lean#L62-L80","doc":"**Theorem (conditional on `Ch4BondSymmetry`)** — the resolving\ndeclaration for `lean.ref` `qou:QOU.Molecular.ch4_lp_dual_binding`.\n\nThe total CH₄ binding energy is exactly `4 · E_bind^{CH}`.  Derived\n(not projected): rewrite the *definitional* sum `E_bind_total =\nΣ E_bind_per_bond` using the `S₄`-symmetry *hypothesis*\n(`bonds_symmetric`, each summand `= E_bind^{CH}`), then evaluate the\nconstant `Fin 4` sum.  A numeric identity computed from the\nhypothesis, not a restated field. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:ch4-lp-dual-binding","label":"prop:ch4-lp-dual-binding","md":"quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/ch4-lp-dual-binding.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.Ch4BondSymmetry.bonds_symmetric","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.Ch4BondSymmetry.bonds_symmetric","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/ch4_lp_dual_binding.lean#L60-L60","doc":"`S₄` symmetry of the optimum: every C–H bond energy equals the\nsingle-bond reference (the ground-state symmetry hypothesis). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.Ch4BondSymmetry.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.Ch4BondSymmetry.mk","kind":"ctor","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/ch4_lp_dual_binding.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.Ch4BondSymmetry","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.Ch4BondSymmetry","kind":"class","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/ch4_lp_dual_binding.lean#L52-L60","doc":"§3b-cond conjecture class (non-degenerate per AGENTS.md §3b-cond\nitem 5): carries the conjectural LP-dual `S₄`-symmetry *hypothesis*\n— every C–H bond has the same binding energy `E_bind^{CH}` — as a\nfield, NOT the conclusion (the total-energy identity is *derived*\nfrom it below). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.Ch4LpDualBindingContext.E_bind_total_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.Ch4LpDualBindingContext.E_bind_total_def","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/ch4_lp_dual_binding.lean#L49-L49","doc":"Total binding is the sum of the four per-bond energies\n(definitional input). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.Ch4LpDualBindingContext.E_bind_total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.Ch4LpDualBindingContext.E_bind_total","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/ch4_lp_dual_binding.lean#L46-L46","doc":"Total binding energy of the CH₄ molecule. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.Ch4LpDualBindingContext.E_bind_CH","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.Ch4LpDualBindingContext.E_bind_CH","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/ch4_lp_dual_binding.lean#L44-L44","doc":"The single C–H bond reference binding energy. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.Ch4LpDualBindingContext.E_bind_per_bond","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.Ch4LpDualBindingContext.E_bind_per_bond","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/ch4_lp_dual_binding.lean#L42-L42","doc":"The per-bond C–H binding energy (indexed by bond `0..3`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.Ch4LpDualBindingContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.Ch4LpDualBindingContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/ch4_lp_dual_binding.lean#L40-L40","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.Ch4LpDualBindingContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.Ch4LpDualBindingContext","kind":"class","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Molecular/ch4_lp_dual_binding.lean#L38-L50","doc":"Data of the CH₄ LP-dual-binding claim. All fields are *inputs*; none\nis the conclusion. ","signatureChunk":0}]}